Am I right in inferring from this that you have auto-pickup turned
on for comestibles?

It seems sensible to me to keep that turned off. Even without the
specific issue of automatic ungloved pickup of footrice corpses,
it's also generally annoying if you're wading through a roomful of
dead monsters and every time you walk across one you have to stop
and drop it again, or answer `no' to `you're having a hard time
lifting a stone giant corpse'. I much prefer to have to manually
press `,' to pick up the occasional comestible that I actually want
to keep.

(That said, it might be nice to have auto-pickup turned on for
things like food rations and turned off for nearly all corpses,
possibly excluding lizards and lichens. I haven't sorted out whether
my installation of NetHack supports this level of detail in the
auto-pickup options, though.)
